{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"37ef59029efddd483423f480b446ed13cc133fd4912cb8f40bc9ab154a41ee34","slug":"best-practices.backup-macos","location":"/best-practices/backup-macOS.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"macOS 数据备份","content_includes_title":false,"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-NC-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial 4.0 International","CC":true}},"github":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101","numbering":{"title":{"offset":2}},"source_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/blob/main/source/best-practices/backup-macOS.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/seismo-learn/seismology101/edit/main/source/best-practices/backup-macOS.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"backup-macOS.md","url":"/seismology101/_public/backup-macOS-af5aafc77fbaf9311f256f4721344e9a.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"div","class":"page-meta","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✍️ 田冬冬、姚家园","key":"e0GZBWAk4b"}],"key":"y9PCbCN7zi"},{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"📅 2021-10-01","key":"ascAR7d1ZW"}],"key":"fOG6ePBjNw"},{"type":"span","class":"page-meta-item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"⏱️ 20 分钟","key":"oZoumhTtbs"}],"key":"OmHz2Duw4k"}],"key":"ntGE1brkp8"}],"key":"x5yfvFzvSt"},{"type":"thematicBreak","key":"Q0r9biAUV0"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Time Machine","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"vnwMs9ZdaY"}],"identifier":"time-machine","label":"Time Machine","html_id":"time-machine","implicit":true,"key":"skEJpSqVHb"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"macOS 下最好用的备份工具当属 Time Machine（时间机器），其可以增量备份 macOS 下的文件，\n能恢复到之前任意备份时刻的状态，并且操作简单。当然也可以使用 ","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"LRV6ZdD9rM"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"rsync","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"JPfkPhJzuO"},{"type":"text","value":" 命令进行备份，\n与 Linux 下相同。推荐使用 Time Machine 进行备份。","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"UeySksOwpy"}],"key":"TljQ8h5FpX"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"首先插入一块备用硬盘，按下 ","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"lbnUcr9yBu"},{"type":"keyboard","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Command","key":"ym0Uzo5mDh"}],"key":"xCX8rzz1kC"},{"type":"text","value":" + ","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"RXluOdyWcc"},{"type":"keyboard","children":[{"type":"text","value":"空格","key":"mQmiNRP5gQ"}],"key":"rZLAiFiRy8"},{"type":"text","value":"，搜索“Disk Utility”并按下\n","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"szNM4med0r"},{"type":"keyboard","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Enter","key":"ljZFdzNpiA"}],"key":"PXn5oaGwff"},{"type":"text","value":" 键以打开磁盘工具。将移动硬盘格式化成 APFS（加密）格式，这也是 macOS Big Sur（11.x）\n的默认格式。读者可以根据自身情况选择分区大小，推荐至少是 macOS 本身硬盘空间的两倍。","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"qhhBSMBuvU"}],"key":"MDtGGK1hTW"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"点击左上角的 Apple 图标，在“系统偏好设置”中，打开“时间机器”。选中“在菜单栏中显示时间机器”。\n点击“选择备份磁盘”，从可用磁盘列表中选择之前格式化的硬盘分区，然后选择“使用磁盘”即可。\n时间机器会立即开始备份。首次备份可能需要很长时间，之后只会同步有改动的文件。下次插入备份硬盘，\n直接从菜单栏的时间机器菜单中选择“立即备份”即开始增量备份。可以选择“进入时间机器”，查看备份内容。\n如需还原备份文件，请参考官方支持","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"zvbhcp7Y9w"},{"type":"link","url":"https://support.apple.com/zh-cn/HT203981","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"从备份恢复 Mac","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"EajBQfhKch"}],"urlSource":"https://support.apple.com/zh-cn/HT203981","key":"sbQpKTU87h"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"XMRNyLTHDV"}],"key":"BQcESXLYbM"}],"key":"kgOgtnxkK2"}],"key":"QM9VjKS9Ht"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"Linux 数据备份","url":"/best-practices/backup-linux","group":"实践经验"},"next":{"title":"Windows 数据备份","url":"/best-practices/backup-windows","group":"实践经验"}}},"domain":"http://pre.render"}